  "details": "When you update your in-game status inside the game, the status in the name tag above your avatar does not update for yourself. It does however change, if you also change your status color from blue to green, green to blue or any other combination, while you are changing the status text\n\nThis has been an issue for over 2½ years, it's not specifically the 1533 build of the game.\n\nExpectation:\n\nWhen you update the text in the status, it should also trigger the name tag status field to update it when you look at your own tag.\n\nThank you VRC staff and happy Halloween and holidays",
